{"ts":"2026-08-28T05:22:46.081Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"kimi-k3","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"23ca3cbcb0ecfb8b1b738906","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"kimi-k3","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-28T05:22:46.081Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-28T05:22:46.081Z","author":"pi-agent","text":"Every acceptance criterion verified against origin/main (HEAD 459a6fb) with the real wiring (`createApp` → mounted `createHealthHandler`), real temp dirs, and stub pools:\n\n- 503 ok:false when PostgreSQL is unreachable, when the projects root is missing, when the projects root is read-only, and when a probe exceeds the 2s bound — each asserted by its own test in test/healthz.test.ts.\n- 200 ok:true with per-dependency breakdown when all hard deps are up; soft deps (Neo4j/Ollama shape) report state and never change the status code; result cached ~5s (\"cached result is reused within 5 seconds\"); no stray `.healthz-*.tmp` files remain; the response never carries credentials, connection strings, hosts, ports, or filesystem paths (\"health response never includes connection strings or credentials\", \"a failing probe never leaks the underlying path, host or message\").\n- Non-vacuity re-proven by mutation on this machine: (a) Postgres probe forced always-ok → \"unreachable database: 503 with postgres.ok:false\" FAILS 200 !== 503. (b) Projects-root probe forced always-ok → \"missing projects root: 503 with projects_root.ok:false\" FAILS 200 !== 503. (c) Probe timeout removed (set to 1h) → \"slow database (exceeds 2s timeout): 503\" FAILS 200 !== 503 after waiting the full 3.55s. All mutations restored; `git status` clean on src/ afterwards.\n- Gates: npm test 352/0, npm run check pass, docstring 80 files / 541 declarations, coverage 67.55/80.81/62.56 vs configured 66/80/60 (met, not lowered). `./node_modules/.bin/pm health --strict-exit` exits 0 (ok:true; 4 pre-existing advisory storage warnings unrelated to this work).\n- Live pm-web.unbrained.dev still serves the old constant from stale build 2026.8.17; repo is 2026.8.27. Redeploy is the orchestrator's step; none performed here.\n"}]}],"before_hash":"c286c1da99ccb08c0d10e846c459b3b4bc7938c64029928c989e7d3d3c186c7b","after_hash":"179ea2b0532de5c87725dc5a3ff81ea823d962d239053085f0221eee196c86ab","item_hash_version":2}
